<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-16T22:24:02.706Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:24:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have seized the Bab al-Mandeb strait and surrounding positions after Yemeni government forces withdrew, giving them control of the key maritime chokepoint. Saudi Arabia dismissed its anti-Houthi coalition commander as rebel forces advance toward Aden, now within 60 km, while Saudi-led coalition units have been forced to retreat from key areas. The coalition intercepted suspected Houthi missiles and drones, but Houthi forces repelled those attacks and killed a senior Yemeni military commander in Al-Jawf. Japan's ONE shipping group transited the Red Sea choke point for the first time in three years, showing limited commercial traffic. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/yemen/20261116-saudi-arabia-dismisses-commander-of-anti-houthi-coalition-as-rebels-advance&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOWnFKVk9tYW9KX21LcTA3Ukxmb0Z2dUVzclRHb0QzWFJvLTBqTC1TTkZPVnhocUxzWmhXUFBxcGlhT09hemJXMU1XRWRqNk9rMFZYbVdrU0Y1aWtZUU9LbG1tTThYODA5WWUwdG5naDlxaU0tVERtZkxGd0dmMVFTYWoyWmowczJWbkVISGIxelpFT0NaSEZCLVZBMzhlQnhhdEpBVlRhYnk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQbllfNkZoYzF4U1ZLdmUtaGE2VnZsblBfeXMyV0xFSEVwcDRya3hzTG1jR2JVS08zYUFBR1laaGhkTVhyZ3hueTl5N1k5ZkFTc3V0blFaUm02WFd0Y2Y2bTR5Rm53XzhTZV8wYy1YWVRNQWo3Vjc5VF9GeXJMaU9zZnhOV3N4aDNkbmcyalJnenlReWFCamtKS0NPZWNLRV9EQ1A3SEVLeU9BNjBvYzd6VzNnQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFAwT2x2Z0hwZ3ZrMG1icWxkYlNvZWN1d2h1ajRtY3lyU08zUERlWmxlM1EtS0s1WGp